// ZeroProbeReport sets value to its zero form (SPEC §5): every field zero, a
// nested type at ITS zero form — not the specified defaults, which NewProbeReport
// builds. A read zeroes the untaken side of a branch with it.
fn ZeroProbeReport(value: ProbeReport&) {
